<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A1.SS7.SSS1" title="In A.7 Modifying existing graph structural encoder ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Learning Laplacian Eigenvectors: a Pre-training Method for Graph Neural Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.7.1 </span>Loss function comparison</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
