<span id="A1.T4.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt">GIN (<a href="#S4.SS1" title="4.1 Standalone pre-training ‣ 4 Experimental Results ‣ Learning Laplacian Eigenvectors: a Pre-training Method for Graph Neural Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></a>)</span>
